[I] GLib library for the Microsoft Graph API

[T] libmsgraph is a GLib-based library for accessing online service APIs using
[T] the Microsoft Graph protocol, used by GNOME Online Accounts to talk to
[T] Office 365 services.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/msgraph

[A] The GNOME Project <gnome-devel-list@gnome.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/network extra/desktop/gnome

[L] LGPL3
